{"t":"2026-05-28T03:50:31.407Z","event":"sdk_msg","msg":{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01Bzt7bQ2RQuiA2iUrRgLnF4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The implementation is complete. Let me provide a summary of what was built:\n\n## Summary\n\nI have implemented cache verification for subsequent runs in `backend/synthetics/scoring_runner.py` per NUTRIENTS.md §I.5 (Cache Contract). The implementation:\n\n### Changes to `scoring_runner.py`:\n\n1. **Added `CacheMissEvent` dataclass** - Records cache miss events with call index, token counts, and timestamp for the run report.\n\n2. **Enhanced `CacheStats` dataclass** with:\n   - `is_subsequent_run: bool` - Flag indicating if this is a subsequent run\n   - `cache_miss_events: list[CacheMissEvent]` - List of cache contract violations\n   - `cache_contract_violated` property - Returns True if subsequent run had cache misses\n   - Updated `record_call()` method to detect and log violations at WARN level when `cache_creation_input_tokens > 0` on subsequent runs\n\n3. **Updated `ScoringSyntheticRunner`**:\n   - Added `is_subsequent_run` parameter to constructor\n   - Propagates flag to all `CacheStats` instances (overall and per-candidate)\n   - Includes `cache_verification` section in run report with:\n     - `is_subsequent_run`: boolean\n     - `cache_contract_violated`: boolean\n     - `cache_miss_events`: list of serialized events\n   - Logs WARN-level messages when violations are detected\n\n### Changes to `cli.py`:\n\n1. Added `--subsequent-run` CLI flag with documentation referencing NUTRIENTS.md §I.5\n2. Updated `run_scoring_suite()` to accept and pass `is_subsequent_run` parameter\n3. Includes cache verification results in the final report\n4. Logs cache contract violations at WARN level\n\n### Contract Compliance (NUTRIENTS.md §I.5):\n\n- ✅ First run: primes the cache (`cache_creation_input_tokens > 0`) - allowed\n- ✅ Subsequent runs: MUST hit cache (`cache_creation_input_tokens == 0`) - verified\n- ✅ If cache verification fails: write `cache_miss` event to report - implemented\n- ✅ Continue execution (do not abort) - execution continues\n- ✅ Log loudly at WARN level - implemented\n- ✅ Run is considered unhealthy but not failed - exit code remains 0\n\n[synthetics-scoring-agent.cache-verification] FRUIT_READY — Implemented cache contract verification to detect when repeated scoring runs fail to hit Claude's prompt cache\n\nSynopsis: Added checks that confirm the scoring system remembers previous work, warning operators when it forgets and has to redo calculations."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1649,"cache_read_input_tokens":119896,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1649,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"71444c5f-670b-4767-91fb-71b1df1f6003","uuid":"a5b84eec-8bda-4af3-bdc5-fd78e9a64a1b"}}
